## Command

```shell
biome check '<TEMP_DIR>/extends_rejects_package_manifest_outside_package/test.js'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "extends": ["config/configs/recommended"] }
```

## `node_modules/config/package.json`

```json
{
    "name": "config",
    "exports": { "biome": "./biome-manifest.json" }
}
```

## `outside/biome-manifest.json`

```json
{
    "version": 1,
    "configs": [{ "recommended": "./recommended.json" }]
}
```

## `outside/recommended.json`

```json
{ "formatter": { "lineWidth": 100 } }
```

